v3.0.6

/bin/ files updated
Game/QuickBMS detection improved
	Known BMS extensions are no longer skipped when another detector identifies the file as media.
	In silent mode, a single matching BMS script is selected automatically.
	Multiple matches are left unresolved rather than guessed.
Descent 3 HOG2 support improved
	Restores the original Unix timestamps of files extracted via QuickBMS from HOG2 archives.
	Includes validation and path-safety checks.
Unicode Inno Setup fix
	When Unicode filenames are temporarily renamed, external Inno files such as setup-1.bin are copied alongside the temporary EXE.
	Temporary sidecar copies are automatically cleaned up afterward.
Extraction result detection improved
	Better classification of OK, FAIL, PASSWORD, CANCELED, NOFREESPACE, and WARN.
	Specifically fixes successful innounp extractions that don't print a conventional final success message.
